{'symbol': 'FITB', 'date': '2023-03-16 12:36:00', 'title': 'FIFTH THIRD BANCORP ANNOUNCES CASH DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'CINCINNATI--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY FIFTH THIRD BANCORP ANNOUNCED THE DECLARATION OF CASH DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON SHARES, SERIES I PREFERRED SHARES, SERIES J PREFERRED SHARES, SERIES K PREFERRED SHARES, SERIES L PREFERRED SHARES, AND CLASS B SERIES A PREFERRED SHARES. FIFTH THIRD BANCORP (NASDAQ: FITB) TODAY DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON SHARES OF $0.33 PER SHARE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2023. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON APRIL 17, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MARCH 31, 2023.'}